==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Thin, [[translucent]] paper used for [[wrapping]] or for [[protecting]] [[delicate]] articles.
# An unspecified product made of [[tissue]] (absorbent paper), such as [[bathroom tissue]], paper handkerchief or household towel.

